# F&B POS — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **3202** — `npm run dev`.

## Stack

Next.js: `app/` + `app/api/`. Prisma: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Domain doc: `doc/02-domain-model.md`.

## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | Dev server :3202 |
| `npm run db:migrate` / `db:seed` | Schema + demo outlets/menu |

## Env

`DATABASE_URL`, `ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID`, `CONTROL_PLANE_URL`, `ORCHESTRATOR_URL`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `ERA_SSO_SHARED_SECRET`, `ERA_FISCAL_PROVIDER`, optional `STOCK_CONSUMPTION_ENABLED`.

## i18n

`messages/{az,ru,en}.json` + `@era/i18n-common`.

## Auth

Staff: `POST /api/auth/login`. PIN clock: `StaffRoster` + `PinClockEvent` via `/api/labor/*`.
